SS_MSG(help,
    EN("Reconstructs with fixed camera poses. Writes dense/roma.ply and dense/manifest.json.\n- Choose a preset and override settings. Booleans accept true/false or 1/0. Pair modes: automatic, sequential, exhaustive, explicit.\n- --config reads resolved JSON. --write-config saves settings only. --checkpoint accepts a local file.\n- Train with --seed-pointcloud dense/roma.ply.\n- Cycle checking needs bidirectional matching. Support counts distinct original images."),
    JA("登録済み画像と固定カメラ姿勢を使用し、dense/roma.ply と dense/manifest.json を出力します。プリセット選択後、以下の設定を変更できます。真偽値: true/false または 1/0。\n- ペア方式: automatic, sequential, exhaustive, explicit。--config は JSON 設定を読み込み、--write-config は処理せず保存します。--checkpoint はローカルファイルを指定します。\n- 学習: --seed-pointcloud dense/roma.ply。往復チェックには双方向照合が必要です。支持数は元画像を数えます。"),
    ZH_HANS("使用已注册图像和固定相机姿态。写入 dense/roma.ply 和 dense/manifest.json。选择预设后可修改下列设置。\n- 布尔值：true/false 或 1/0。配对方式：automatic、sequential、exhaustive、explicit。--config 读取 JSON 设置；--write-config 仅保存设置。--checkpoint 接受本地文件。\n- 训练：--seed-pointcloud dense/roma.ply。循环检查需要双向匹配；支持数按不同原始图像计算。"),
    ZH_HANT("使用已註冊影像與固定相機姿態。寫入 dense/roma.ply 和 dense/manifest.json。選擇預設後可修改下列設定。\n- 布林值：true/false 或 1/0。配對方式：automatic、sequential、exhaustive、explicit。--config 讀取 JSON 設定；--write-config 僅儲存設定。--checkpoint 接受本機檔案。\n- 訓練：--seed-pointcloud dense/roma.ply。循環檢查需要雙向匹配；支持數按不同原始影像計算。"),
    KO("등록된 이미지와 고정 카메라 포즈로 dense/roma.ply 및 dense/manifest.json을 만듭니다. 프리셋 선택 후 아래 설정을 변경할 수 있습니다. 불리언: true/false 또는 1/0.\n- 쌍 모드: automatic, sequential, exhaustive, explicit. --config는 JSON 설정을 읽고 --write-config는 처리 없이 저장합니다. --checkpoint는 로컬 파일입니다.\n- 학습: --seed-pointcloud dense/roma.ply. 순환 검사는 양방향 매칭이 필요하며 지원 수는 서로 다른 원본 이미지 수입니다."),
    DE("Verwendet registrierte Bilder und feste Kameraposen. Schreibt dense/roma.ply und dense/manifest.json.\n- Nach der Voreinstellung sind alle Werte unten änderbar. Boolesch: true/false oder 1/0.\n- Paarmodi: automatic, sequential, exhaustive, explicit. --config liest JSON; --write-config speichert ohne Verarbeitung. --checkpoint nimmt eine lokale Datei.\n- Training: --seed-pointcloud dense/roma.ply.\n- Zyklusprüfung erfordert bidirektionalen Abgleich; Unterstützung zählt verschiedene Originalbilder."),
    FR("Utilise les images enregistrées et des poses fixes. Écrit dense/roma.ply et dense/manifest.json.\n- Choisissez un préréglage puis modifiez les valeurs ci-dessous. Booléens : true/false ou 1/0.\n- Paires : automatic, sequential, exhaustive, explicit. --config lit le JSON ; --write-config sauvegarde sans traitement. --checkpoint accepte un fichier local.\n- Entraînement : --seed-pointcloud dense/roma.ply. La vérification de cycle exige un appariement bidirectionnel ; le support compte les images originales distinctes."),
    ES("Usa imágenes registradas y poses fijas. Escribe dense/roma.ply y dense/manifest.json. Elija un ajuste y cambie los valores siguientes.\n- Booleanos: true/false o 1/0. Pares: automatic, sequential, exhaustive, explicit. --config lee JSON; --write-config guarda sin procesar. --checkpoint acepta un archivo local.\n- Entrenamiento: --seed-pointcloud dense/roma.ply.\n- La comprobación de ciclo requiere coincidencias bidireccionales;\n- el soporte cuenta imágenes originales distintas."),
    PT("Usa imagens registradas e poses fixas. Grava dense/roma.ply e dense/manifest.json. Escolha uma predefinição e altere os valores abaixo. Booleanos: true/false ou 1/0.\n- Pares: automatic, sequential, exhaustive, explicit. --config lê JSON; --write-config salva sem processar. --checkpoint aceita um arquivo local.\n- Treino: --seed-pointcloud dense/roma.ply.\n- A verificação de ciclo exige correspondência bidirecional; o suporte conta imagens originais distintas."),
    IT("Usa immagini registrate e pose fisse. Scrive dense/roma.ply e dense/manifest.json. Scegliere una preimpostazione e modificare i valori sotto. Booleani: true/false o 1/0.\n- Coppie: automatic, sequential, exhaustive, explicit. --config legge JSON; --write-config salva senza elaborare. --checkpoint accetta un file locale.\n- Addestramento: --seed-pointcloud dense/roma.ply. Il controllo del ciclo richiede corrispondenze bidirezionali;\n- il supporto conta immagini originali distinte."),
    NL("Gebruikt geregistreerde afbeeldingen en vaste camerastanden. Schrijft dense/roma.ply en dense/manifest.json.\n- Kies een preset en wijzig onderstaande waarden. Booleaans: true/false of 1/0.\n- Paren: automatic, sequential, exhaustive, explicit. --config leest JSON; --write-config slaat op zonder verwerking. --checkpoint accepteert een lokaal bestand.\n- Training: --seed-pointcloud dense/roma.ply. Cycluscontrole vereist tweerichtingskoppeling; ondersteuning telt verschillende oorspronkelijke afbeeldingen."),
    RU("Использует зарегистрированные изображения и фиксированные камеры. Записывает dense/roma.ply и dense/manifest.json.\n- Выберите набор и измените значения ниже. Логические: true/false или 1/0.\n- Пары: automatic, sequential, exhaustive, explicit. --config читает JSON; --write-config сохраняет без обработки. --checkpoint принимает локальный файл.\n- Обучение: --seed-pointcloud dense/roma.ply.\n- Проверка цикла требует двунаправленного сопоставления; поддержка считает разные исходные изображения."),
    TR("Kayıtlı görüntüler ve sabit kamera pozlarıyla dense/roma.ply ve dense/manifest.json yazar. Ön ayardan sonra aşağıdaki değerleri değiştirebilirsiniz. Mantıksal:\n- true/false veya 1/0. Çiftler: automatic, sequential, exhaustive, explicit. --config JSON okur; --write-config işlemeden kaydeder. --checkpoint yerel dosya alır.\n- Eğitim: --seed-pointcloud dense/roma.ply.\n- Döngü kontrolü çift yönlü eşleştirme ister; destek farklı özgün görüntüleri sayar."));

